@Definition("verified-account", '''
A verified account has completed email ownership checks.
Use `User.isVerified` to gate write actions.
''')

@Definition("moderation-policy", '''
Messages pass `Moderation` before delivery.
Flagged users are reviewed by operations within one business day.
''')

@Rule("verified-sender", '''
Only verified users can send first-contact messages.
See @Definition("verified-account") for exact semantics.
''')

@Rule("soft-delete-retention", '''
Records are soft-deleted first and retained for audit.
Use nullable `deletedAt` fields across persistence models.
''')

@Rule("moderation-required", '''
All outbound messages are checked by `Moderation`.
Blocked content is never persisted as delivered.
''')

@Decision("single-workspace-mvp", '''
The MVP supports one workspace per account.
Multi-workspace support is deferred until enterprise onboarding.
''')

@OpenQuestion("edit-window-duration", '''
How long can a sender edit a message after sending?
Candidates: 2 minutes, 15 minutes, or unlimited for same day.
''')

